# MKRWW/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-AutoRound — stable two-agent baseline
# Source: https://huggingface.co/MKRWW/Qwen3.8-27B-int4-AutoRound
#
# W4A16, group size 128. The author reports the model's MTP head is preserved,
# but this first profile intentionally leaves MTP out of the unpatched stack.
# Establish tool-call and c1/c2 long-context stability before testing it.
#
# BENCHMARK_SUMMARY_BEGIN
